WEBVTT

1
00:00:34.583 --> 00:00:38.375
In the previous verse, Arjuna
 asked about that yogi

2
00:00:38.375 --> 00:00:42.208
who started walking on the path of spirituality,

3
00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:44.541
but due to uncontrolled mind,

4
00:00:44.541 --> 00:00:47.250
couldn't attain perfection in yoga.

5
00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:49.166
Arjuna expressed concern

6
00:00:49.166 --> 00:00:51.541
that such a yogi would remain stuck

7
00:00:51.541 --> 00:00:54.541
between materialism and spirituality.

8
00:00:54.541 --> 00:00:58.250
Along with this, Arjuna also
 prayed to Lord Krishna 

9
00:00:58.250 --> 00:01:01.500
to resolve his doubts.

10
00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:04.375
Now in the next few verses, Lord Krishna

11
00:01:04.375 --> 00:01:07.458
will answer these very doubts of Arjuna.

12
00:01:12.416 --> 00:01:14.541
In the previous few verses, Arjuna

13
00:01:14.541 --> 00:01:17.541
expressed concern about the future

14
00:01:17.541 --> 00:01:18.958
of such a yogi who

15
00:01:18.958 --> 00:01:21.458
couldn't attain complete
 perfection on the path of yoga, 

16
00:01:21.458 --> 00:01:24.500
and who left this path in the middle.

17
00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:26.250
In response to that,

18
00:01:26.250 --> 00:01:27.791
through this verse,

19
00:01:27.791 --> 00:01:30.166
Lord Krishna is giving assurance to Arjuna

20
00:01:30.166 --> 00:01:32.583
and also boosting his morale.

21
00:01:32.583 --> 00:01:35.333
Lord Krishna says, O Pārtha,

22
00:01:35.333 --> 00:01:39.000
such a person will not have to
 suffer any loss or destruction.

23
00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:41.916
Neither in this world nor in the next.

24
00:01:41.916 --> 00:01:44.000
Because those who do good deeds

25
00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:47.333
always remain protected from downfall.

26
00:01:47.333 --> 00:01:47.625
In this verse,

27
00:01:47.625 --> 00:01:52.041
Lord Krishna's affection toward
 Arjuna clearly shows.

28
00:01:52.041 --> 00:01:53.000
First,

29
00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:55.500
he addresses Arjuna by calling him Pārtha,

30
00:01:55.500 --> 00:01:57.541
which shows their closeness,

31
00:01:57.541 --> 00:01:58.541
and then ahead,

32
00:01:58.541 --> 00:01:59.375
Lord Krishna

33
00:01:59.375 --> 00:02:00.500
uses the word

34
00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:03.208
tāta, meaning 'my dear.'

35
00:02:03.208 --> 00:02:05.000
Lord Krishna is clarifying

36
00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:06.750
that the person who walks

37
00:02:06.750 --> 00:02:08.208
on the spiritual path,

38
00:02:08.208 --> 00:02:10.875
even if they don't attain complete perfection,

39
00:02:10.875 --> 00:02:14.500
still for this reason they will face no loss,

40
00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:17.125
neither in this life nor in the next life.

41
00:02:17.125 --> 00:02:20.666
Meaning the journey of yoga
 being left incomplete

42
00:02:20.666 --> 00:02:24.125
won't bring any punishment or suffering.

43
00:02:24.125 --> 00:02:28.416
The main message here is this – that spirituality

44
00:02:28.416 --> 00:02:32.166
or any step taken toward yoga practice

45
00:02:32.166 --> 00:02:33.708
doesn't go to waste.

46
00:02:33.708 --> 00:02:34.875
Krishna here

47
00:02:34.875 --> 00:02:37.000
uses the word kalyāņa-křt.

48
00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:38.500
Meaning that person

49
00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:41.666
who is doing auspicious and welfare deeds.

50
00:02:41.666 --> 00:02:44.250
This word represents, along with a yogi,

51
00:02:44.250 --> 00:02:46.375
every person

52
00:02:46.375 --> 00:02:49.708
who is advancing on the path of spirituality

53
00:02:49.708 --> 00:02:51.625
and making efforts

54
00:02:51.625 --> 00:02:54.041
for self-realization and liberation.

55
00:02:54.041 --> 00:02:56.500
Lord Krishna says that the
 end of such kalyāņa-kṛt

56
00:02:56.500 --> 00:03:00.083
person is never in downfall.

57
00:03:00.083 --> 00:03:03.416
This is so because whether the journey of yoga

58
00:03:03.416 --> 00:03:06.833
is complete or not, every step taken on this path

59
00:03:06.833 --> 00:03:11.291
is auspicious, and this very
 thing will protect from downfall.

60
00:03:11.291 --> 00:03:15.666
Lord Krishna wants to assure Arjuna and all of us

61
00:03:15.666 --> 00:03:18.416
that any effort made for spirituality

62
00:03:18.416 --> 00:03:21.666
and yoga doesn't go to waste.

63
00:03:21.666 --> 00:03:24.750
Neither in this birth nor in the next birth.

64
00:03:24.750 --> 00:03:28.083
Its result is only pleasant.

65
00:03:32.458 --> 00:03:35.208
Arjuna was worried

66
00:03:35.208 --> 00:03:38.416
that if the path of yoga

67
00:03:38.416 --> 00:03:41.375
is left in the middle,

68
00:03:41.375 --> 00:03:45.250
then what will be the condition of the yogi?

69
00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:49.041
So just the answer to this is this.

70
00:03:49.041 --> 00:03:51.041
For Arjuna too

71
00:03:51.041 --> 00:03:53.416
and for you too –

72
00:03:53.416 --> 00:03:57.375
that if you walk on the path of goodness,

73
00:03:57.375 --> 00:04:02.083
then even if you don't reach your destination,

74
00:04:02.083 --> 00:04:05.125
your any effort

75
00:04:05.125 --> 00:04:07.291
won't go to waste.

76
00:04:07.291 --> 00:04:11.666
Every small to smallest good deed

77
00:04:11.666 --> 00:04:15.750
will only give benefit,

78
00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:17.166
this is true.

79
00:04:17.166 --> 00:04:22.250
This truth will give peace to every anxious mind.

80
00:04:22.250 --> 00:04:24.416
In life, many times a person

81
00:04:24.416 --> 00:04:27.208
walks toward some purpose,

82
00:04:27.208 --> 00:04:30.333
makes their efforts, but

83
00:04:30.333 --> 00:04:33.416
can't reach the destination.

84
00:04:33.416 --> 00:04:35.666
In such a case, there's despair

85
00:04:35.666 --> 00:04:38.875
that all efforts went to waste.

86
00:04:38.875 --> 00:04:40.791
No!

87
00:04:40.791 --> 00:04:42.708
Remember this –

88
00:04:42.708 --> 00:04:46.500
any step taken with truth

89
00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:48.625
won't go to waste.

90
00:04:48.625 --> 00:04:52.500
Just see by changing your perspective.

91
00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:54.291
For example,

92
00:04:54.291 --> 00:04:58.250
if even after hard work by some scientist,

93
00:04:58.250 --> 00:05:01.500
some invention remained incomplete,

94
00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:05.666
still their hard work didn't fail.

95
00:05:05.666 --> 00:05:08.791
Because now their understanding of science

96
00:05:08.791 --> 00:05:12.166
is deeper than before.

97
00:05:12.166 --> 00:05:14.750
They know that in the next effort

98
00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:16.500
what to do now.

99
00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:19.833
It's also possible some other scientist

100
00:05:19.833 --> 00:05:22.958
now completes that same incomplete invention.

101
00:05:22.958 --> 00:05:27.166
And this is the same with every good deed.

102
00:05:27.166 --> 00:05:32.000
Every good and pure deed is like a seed.

103
00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:34.208
If you keep sowing seeds,

104
00:05:34.208 --> 00:05:39.291
then if not today, tomorrow, some seed
 will sprout, will become a tree,

105
00:05:39.291 --> 00:05:42.666
one day will give sweet fruit.

106
00:05:42.666 --> 00:05:45.416
Whether it's the seed of spirituality,

107
00:05:45.416 --> 00:05:53.958
of yoga, of charity, or the seed of hard work
 or help done with true heart.

108
00:05:53.958 --> 00:05:57.208
All these are good deeds,

109
00:05:57.208 --> 00:05:59.583
won't go to waste.

110
00:05:59.583 --> 00:06:02.500
Whether the pace is slow, whether progress

111
00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:04.041
doesn't seem visible.

112
00:06:04.041 --> 00:06:10.750
But every small step is taking you forward.

113
00:06:10.750 --> 00:06:13.500
Keeping this faith firm,

114
00:06:13.500 --> 00:06:16.125
keep doing good deeds.

115
00:06:20.458 --> 00:06:24.208
In Arjuna's mind there are doubts.

116
00:06:24.208 --> 00:06:27.458
Related to a yogi's journey

117
00:06:27.458 --> 00:06:29.958
there are some concerns.

118
00:06:29.958 --> 00:06:33.375
He needs affection.

119
00:06:33.375 --> 00:06:36.541
He needs assurance.

120
00:06:36.541 --> 00:06:40.083
At this time he doesn't need criticism,

121
00:06:40.083 --> 00:06:44.041
he needs right knowledge.

122
00:06:44.041 --> 00:06:47.541
And this is my purpose.

123
00:06:47.541 --> 00:06:50.750
If some family member comes before you

124
00:06:50.750 --> 00:06:54.375
with their doubt or concern,

125
00:06:54.375 --> 00:06:57.166
then listening to them carefully

126
00:06:57.166 --> 00:07:00.833
is most important.

127
00:07:00.833 --> 00:07:02.958
Think –

128
00:07:02.958 --> 00:07:05.750
if someone peacefully

129
00:07:05.750 --> 00:07:09.416
understands your circumstance and condition,

130
00:07:09.416 --> 00:07:14.416
then just from that a burden becomes lighter.

131
00:07:14.416 --> 00:07:18.958
In the family, if someone is
 struggling with difficult times,

132
00:07:18.958 --> 00:07:21.875
then respect their feelings.

133
00:07:21.875 --> 00:07:26.541
Never mock their concern.

134
00:07:26.541 --> 00:07:29.125
Because the truth is this, right,

135
00:07:29.125 --> 00:07:31.625
that everyone is learning.

136
00:07:31.625 --> 00:07:36.250
If some problem seems trivial to you,

137
00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:38.750
then look into the past.

138
00:07:38.750 --> 00:07:41.416
There was a moment when

139
00:07:41.416 --> 00:07:46.083
this same problem seemed big to you too.

140
00:07:46.083 --> 00:07:48.000
Didn't it?

141
00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:51.041
If some problem is trivial for you,

142
00:07:51.041 --> 00:07:52.958
this doesn't mean

143
00:07:52.958 --> 00:07:56.208
that it's trivial for everyone.

144
00:07:56.208 --> 00:08:02.875
So never start with mockery or criticism.

145
00:08:02.875 --> 00:08:04.875
If you do this,

146
00:08:04.875 --> 00:08:08.625
this is only your ego,

147
00:08:08.625 --> 00:08:10.916
and in the future people

148
00:08:10.916 --> 00:08:15.000
will shy away from telling
 you their mental state.

149
00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:16.708
Remember,

150
00:08:16.708 --> 00:08:21.583
the first step is consolation and understanding.

151
00:08:21.583 --> 00:08:24.750
The second step is assurance.

152
00:08:24.750 --> 00:08:26.750
Give this assurance

153
00:08:26.750 --> 00:08:29.750
that everything will be fine.

154
00:08:29.750 --> 00:08:32.208
Because this is the truth.

155
00:08:32.208 --> 00:08:35.333
If not today then tomorrow, done with truth.

156
00:08:35.333 --> 00:08:40.291
Every small effort will bear fruit.

157
00:08:40.291 --> 00:08:43.791
Now you can take the third step.

158
00:08:43.791 --> 00:08:45.708
Guidance.

159
00:08:45.708 --> 00:08:49.958
Tell the right path from your experience.

160
00:08:49.958 --> 00:08:54.166
Just as I, going forward, will show Arjuna

161
00:08:54.166 --> 00:08:58.541
and you too every right path.

162
00:08:58.541 --> 00:09:01.333
So just, consolation,

163
00:09:01.333 --> 00:09:05.500
assurance, and guidance –

164
00:09:05.500 --> 00:09:08.291
remember this sequence.

165
00:09:12.500 --> 00:09:14.333
Spirituality

166
00:09:14.333 --> 00:09:18.500
and any step taken on the path of yoga

167
00:09:18.500 --> 00:09:20.958
doesn't go to waste.

168
00:09:20.958 --> 00:09:24.916
Whether success in yoga is visible or not,

169
00:09:24.916 --> 00:09:29.250
but benefit happens from just the effort.

170
00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:33.208
And this is also appropriate for every good deed.

171
00:09:33.208 --> 00:09:35.333
Any good deed

172
00:09:35.333 --> 00:09:38.541
ultimately bears fruit.

173
00:09:38.541 --> 00:09:42.416
But in professional life, many times people,

174
00:09:42.416 --> 00:09:45.208
when they don't see success on the path

175
00:09:45.208 --> 00:09:48.958
of hard work or ethical deeds,

176
00:09:48.958 --> 00:09:50.666
become anxious.

177
00:09:50.666 --> 00:09:52.333
They either become discouraged,

178
00:09:52.333 --> 00:09:55.666
or abandoning the path of truth, for progress

179
00:09:55.666 --> 00:09:57.208
they start taking help

180
00:09:57.208 --> 00:10:01.833
of unethical means or deceit, etc.

181
00:10:01.833 --> 00:10:03.291
But

182
00:10:03.291 --> 00:10:06.125
the sorrow is this – that ultimately

183
00:10:06.125 --> 00:10:10.000
on this path, they will only face loss.

184
00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:13.041
Because in the end, purification of the mind

185
00:10:13.041 --> 00:10:16.041
is paramount.

186
00:10:16.041 --> 00:10:18.291
If there's a pile of wealth

187
00:10:18.291 --> 00:10:22.500
but the mind remains dirty, 
then only sorrow will be received.

188
00:10:22.500 --> 00:10:24.875
Therefore, whatever work you do,

189
00:10:24.875 --> 00:10:26.875
do it with pure mind.

190
00:10:26.875 --> 00:10:28.375
When you walk on the path

191
00:10:28.375 --> 00:10:31.041
of ethics and truth,

192
00:10:31.041 --> 00:10:34.458
then even if progress is slow, but

193
00:10:34.458 --> 00:10:37.708
your future will always remain secure.

194
00:10:37.708 --> 00:10:41.750
You may get success late,

195
00:10:41.750 --> 00:10:45.416
but it will be permanent. And along with this,

196
00:10:45.416 --> 00:10:49.500
you'll get the happiness of a calm mind.

197
00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:51.250
This is

198
00:10:51.250 --> 00:10:53.750
the ultimate purpose.
